@startuml
title Class structure — Adopt the PromiseHub design system
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class Button <<Component>> {
  +variant: ButtonVariant
  +size: ButtonSize
  +busy: boolean
  selector = "button[ph-button], a[ph-button]"
}
class AccessibleDialog <<Directive>> {
  +escape: output "phDialogEscape"
  selector = "[phAccessibleDialog]"
}
class Shell <<Component>> {
  selector = "ph-shell"
}
class DisplayPreferencesService <<Service>> {
  +apply(preferences)
  sets data-theme, ph-a11y-*, --ph-text-scale
}
class "tokens.css" as Tokens <<Stylesheet>> {
  PromiseHub primitives and semantic tokens
  light, dark, preference overrides
  Waypoint extensions
}
class "core.css" as Core <<Stylesheet>> {
  --ph-* aliases
  ph-* layout utilities and shell
}
class "button.css" as ButtonCss <<Stylesheet>>
Button ..> ButtonCss : styled by
Shell ..> Core : styled by
ButtonCss ..> Core : reads --ph-*
ButtonCss ..> Tokens : reads --color-*
Core ..> Tokens : aliases
DisplayPreferencesService --> Tokens : selects theme
AccessibleDialog --> Shell : used inside screens of
@enduml
